 0 / number of parameters                           ZGCOUNT =                    1 / number of groups                               ZTILE1  =                 2400 / size of tiles to be compressed                 ZTILE2  =                    1 / size of tiles to be compressed                 ZCMPTYPE= 'RICE_1  '           / compression algorithm                          ZNAME1  = 'BLOCKSIZE'          / compression block size                         ZVAL1   =                   32 / pixels per block                               ZNAME2  = 'BYTEPIX '           / bytes per pixel (1, 2, 4, or 8)                ZVAL2   =                    1 / bytes per pixel (1, 2, 4, or 8)                EXTNAME = 'BPM     '           / name of this binary table extension            EXTVER  =                    1                                                  END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀%␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀C␀␀␀␀␀␀a␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀»␀␀␀␀␀␀Ù␀␀␀␀␀␀÷␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀3␀␀␀␀␀Q␀␀␀␀␀o␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀«␀␀␀␀␀É␀␀␀␀␀ç␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀#␀␀␀␀␀A␀␀␀␀␀_␀␀␀␀␀}␀␀␀␀␀›␀␀␀␀␀¹␀␀␀␀␀×␀␀␀␀␀õ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀1␀␀␀␀␀O␀␀␀␀␀m␀␀␀␀␀‹␀␀␀␀␀©␀␀␀␀␀Ç␀␀␀␀␀å␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀!␀␀␀␀␀?␀␀␀␀␀]␀␀␀␀␀{␀␀␀␀␀™␀␀␀␀␀·␀␀␀␀␀Õ␀␀␀␀␀ó␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀/␀␀␀␀␀M␀␀␀␀␀k␀␀␀␀␀‰␀␀␀␀␀§␀␀␀␀␀Å␀␀␀␀␀ã␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀